Package: fable.rjd3
Type: Package
Title: 'JDemetra+' v3 Seasonal Adjustment Models for 'fable'
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Provides an interface to JDemetra+ v3 seasonal adjustment algorithms 
    (X-13ARIMA-SEATS and TRAMO-SEATS) for use with the 'fable' forecasting and 
    decomposition framework. It enables seasonal adjustment on 'tsibble' objects 
    using the standard 'model()' and 'components()' workflow.
